  "title": "World Kinect Corporation Increases Regular Quarterly Cash Dividend by 15%",
  "summary": "MIAMI --(BUSINESS WIRE)--Jun. 18, 2026-- World Kinect Corporation (NYSE: WKC) announced today that its board of directors has declared a quarterly cash dividend of $0.23 per share, an increase of 15% over its previous dividend of $0.20 per share. The dividend is payable on July 16, 2026 to",
